// GetEscalatedExchange (TestEscalationReadsChatOnlyViaTicketQueries cho phép riêng hai truy vấn liệt kê này; proposals #13). status_filter: OPEN|CLAIMED|ANSWERED|ALL (ALL gồm CLOSED).
